6","authorChannelId":"UCfX3qAIFeQ_3t8WX1N8z3xg","authorAvatar":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kPNnJDRSww_AfeBDBTzg3RrEw0RJ3-BfBdSfA6VlayosI=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj","text":"We really enjoyed this movie. The cinematography and lighting were, for me as a photographer, amazing. Every shot was like an illustrated page of a book. Every scene was perfectly centered and positioned into the golden rectangle with such amazing consistency. I've not noticed that in other movies. The camera dollies from one \"stage set\" to the next. The story of young love portrayed with such self-aware and mature points of view is, for me, extremely appealing. These two bright kids seize the day and go forward with confidence although they are surrounded by doubters. Can't wait to watch it again.","likes":1,"publishedText":"12 years ago","owner":false,"pinned":false,"url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_eOI3AamSm8&lc=Ugg_WxzhokNSnXgCoAEC"},{"id":"UgjXsmog6n6eK3gCoAEC","author":"@AverageWagie","authorChannelId":"UCh3fZ8YBB25sSH578cpQ2cg","authorAvatar":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/6bbUS0tf765aWe3sz3gOv7wAoSiNQmoYlTiVY4s9zTIfsmHkk1ZaTSIM7ZcJoczhGFlwJgH8Ag=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj","text":"How to troll your action movie lover boyfriend:\nMe: Honey, do you want to watch a Bruce Willis movie?\nBF: Hell yeah!\nMe: * proceeds to play Moonrise Kingdom *\nBF: Damn.\n\n(No disrespect to action movie fans intended)","likes":1,"publishedText":"11 years ago","owner":false,"pinned":false,"url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_eOI3AamSm8&lc=UgjXsmog6n6eK3gCoAEC"}],"total":1042,"order":"top"}
